<title>GERMANY: Telekom IPO still oversubscribed - sources.</title>
<headline>Telekom IPO still oversubscribed - sources.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom's offering of shares is still oversubscribed even after the group on Monday responded to overwhelming demand and topped up its stock offering, banking sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The sources said the share offer was now oversubscribed by four times. The issue was previously estimated to have been oversubscribed by six times.</p>
<p>Telekom on Monday topped up its stock offer with 100 million additional shares.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
